description: |
    The :ref:`/plugins/prepare/install` plugin now exposes a ``check-first``
    key. When enabled, which is the default and also the behavior of tmt so
    far, package presence is checked before installation, which can prevent
    unintended upgrades on systems that use some form of the ``--best`` option,
    like CentOS Stream 10. Disable this feature to skip the package presence
    check before installation.
